            "label": "Master, MV Freya",
            "title": "Ewan MacAskill",
            "body": "Twenty-six seasons in the Hebrides. Reads a sky faster than a forecast, and has been right more often than the forecast.",
            "linkLabel": "",
            "linkHref": ""
           },
           {
            "src": "https://qvzbothxlrzeklcvdhzp.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/coastwise/crew-mate.jpg",
