            "alt": "Ingrid Solheim on deck",
            "label": "Master, MV Skua",
            "title": "Ingrid Solheim",
            "body": "Grew up piloting her father’s fjord ferry. Knows which arms hold their glass at dusk, and anchors there.",
            "linkLabel": "",
            "linkHref": ""
           },
           {
            "src": "https://qvzbothxlrzeklcvdhzp.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/coastwise/crew-engineer.jpg",
